      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "• /api/pay — verify on-chain receipt\n• /api/demo-sign-and-pay — server signs USDC\n• On-chain verification (poll receipt, verify Transfer)\n• Resend email receipt",
      "rawText": "• /api/merchants (CRUD)\n• /api/pay — verify on-chain\n• /api/demo-sign-and-pay — server signs USDC\n• /api/stt — Whisper endpoint (stub)\n• On-chain verification:\n  - Poll eth_getTransactionReceipt\n  - Check USDC Transfer event\n  - Verify recipient = treasury\n  - Verify amount ≥ expected\n• Resend email receipt\n• JSON file storage (payments/merchants)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• /api/merchants (CRUD)\n• /api/pay — verify on-chain\n• /api/demo-sign-and-pay — server signs USDC\n• /api/stt — Whisper endpoint (stub)\n• On-chain verification:\n  - Poll eth_getTransactionReceipt\n  - Check USDC Transfer event\n  - Verify recipient = treasury\n  - Verify amount ≥ expected\n• Resend email receipt\n• JSON file storage (payments/merchants)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
